Dear Marc, Sven, and everyone else,

 There is no theoretical reason to use DA in most cases and especially from a practical standpoint when the mixing is so poor.  The 2nd variation of the model that Sven suggests is much preferred.  This is covered in Section 11.7 of the AHM2 book (Distance Sampling based on Pixel Frequencies we called it).  Also we implemented it in unmarked which is described in AHM1 (9.8.4). see also 11.7.2 in AHM2 where we expanded on that implementation a bit.

regards
andy

